@startwbs
title OrderFulfillmentWorkflowImpl 方法責任分層圖

skinparam defaultFontName "Heiti TC"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white

<style>
wbsDiagram {
  node {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #475569
    FontColor #0F172A
  }
  :depth(0) {
    BackgroundColor #E8F1FF
    LineColor #2563EB
  }
  .boundary {
    BackgroundColor #E8F1FF
  }
  .cancellation {
    BackgroundColor #FDECEC
  }
  .guard {
    BackgroundColor #FFF7D6
  }
  .projection {
    BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  }
}
</style>

* OrderFulfillmentWorkflowImpl
** Temporal boundary methods <<boundary>>
*** @WorkflowInit constructor(OrderFulfillmentInput)
*** @WorkflowMethod execute(OrderFulfillmentInput)
*** @SignalMethod stockOperationAssigned()
*** @SignalMethod shipmentHandedOverToCarrier()
*** @SignalMethod shipmentCancelled()
*** @UpdateValidatorMethod validateCancellationRequest()
*** @UpdateMethod requestCancellation()
*** @QueryMethod state()
** execute 主線 helpers
*** Typed Activity stubs
**** InventoryAllocationActivities / InventoryMovementActivities / OrderActivities / ShipmentActivities
**** 共用 retry policy；各 use case 自己保證業務冪等
*** Allocation state
**** StockOperationAssignmentState.markRequested()
**** isRequested() / isCommitted()
**** recordAssigned() / assignmentSnapshot()
**** stockOperationId() / canReceiveAssignment()
*** Shipment state
**** ShipmentState.recordCreated()
**** recordHandover() / recordCancelled()
**** canAcceptTerminalFor() <<guard>>
**** hasCancellation() / hasHandover()
**** shipmentIdOrNull() / terminalStatusOrNull() / terminalAtOrNull()
*** Cancellation state
**** CancellationState.isRequested()
**** request() / conflictsWith() <<guard>>
**** requestIdOrNull() / requestedAtOrNull()
*** Mainline helpers
**** markFinished()
** 取消協調 helpers <<cancellation>>
*** requestShipmentCancellationActivity()：command ACK，不代表 terminal
*** cancelOrderActivityAndFinish(cancelledAt)
** Query／progress helpers <<projection>>
*** WorkflowProgress.enterPhase()
*** enterPhase()

legend bottom
  |<#E8F1FF>| Temporal boundary |
  |<#FDECEC>| 取消協調 |
  |<#FFF7D6>| correlation／contract guard |
  |<#F1F5F9>| Query／可觀測性／共用技術 helper |
endlegend
@endwbs
